# Ancillary operator archives: too large for git (85 MB / 27 MB / 22 MB), and git keeps every
# version forever.  Distribute them via Zenodo or a GitHub release instead.  The companion
# *_encoders_n1-20.npz files (18 kB) ARE tracked: the encoder is the essential object, and the
# decoder follows from it by solving the recovery SDP.
anc/superactivation_operators_n1-20.npz
anc/superactivation_operators_n17.npz
anc/superactivation_operators_n17_aux.npz
anc_2/depolarizing_operators_n1-20.npz
anc_2/amplitude_damping_operators_n1-20.npz

